  "content": "<p align=\"center\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6b97b4914b800a270c516522b9af697dc176b359.png\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\" border=\"0\"/>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n    <a href=\"https://discord.gg/hM7UhuRFaa\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7e84ea1620a5fb574fc32bdda57ca8319c3a29dc.png\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" border=\"10\"/>\n    </a>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n    <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/kingybu\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/877ebfd2654ffc553f963d6871513d935b3c741f.png\" width=\"220\" height=\"220\" border=\"10\"/>\n    </a>\n</p>\n\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/kingybusiness/\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/1bb902bda9644d160934a49c82aa5377c21fc04e.png\" width=\"250\" height=\"200\" border=\"10\"/>\n            </a>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n厌倦了每次走近附魔台都看到和制作台一样的灰色菜单？想在游戏里增添些色彩吗？介绍 Colourful Containers！一款旨在让所有可交互方块界面更加多彩的容器GUI替换模组。抛开表演，这款材质包将替换如熔炉等方块的界面，新菜单的设计灵感来源于对应的方块，甚至还有一些动画效果！\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/kingybusiness/\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8b1bffa45a702faf668e0c0dbf3ac500976c135b.png\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\" border=\"10\"/>\n            </a>\n</p>\n\n![预览](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/0827f268aedbbdd141db8901e900d52fa7f30723.png)\n\n<p align=\"left\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/25ec88d0a4280c363ce8e6880a6b31050d74da85.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" border=\"0\"/></p>\n\n- 铁砧\n- 配方书\n- 高炉\n- 炼药台\n- 制图桌\n- 箱子（大型、小型、末地）*需OptiGUI支持*\n- 工作台\n- 发射器\n- 投掷器optifine.png\n- 附魔台\n- 熔炉\n- 研磨台\n- 漏斗\n- 织布机\n- 潜影盒（全色）*需OptiGUI支持*\n- 烟熏炉\n- 石匠工作台\n- 锻造台\n- 桶\n- 自定义村民GUI *需OptiGUI支持*\n- 信标\n- 合成器\n- 生存背包\n\n<p align=\"left\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ccf71bfc1e97e6dba3be810afd4d8d80ffcce7c3.png\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" border=\"0\"/></p>- 创意模式库存\n- 模组支持\n\n<p align=\"left\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5f7fe74c90e1c2c59cc969e12bd49d2220ade505.png\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\"/></p>\n\n**Chris_XENO**\n**BurntToast_**\n**Kingybu**",
